                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "40612613",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198006413390",
                            "num_reviews": 224,
                            "playtime_forever": 629,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 595,
                            "last_played": 1520950769
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I recently got this game for free from a curator connect offer in my group 100% Achievements Events group. This 3D simulation game with arcade reaction-based action gameplay by b-alive gmbh features a custom avatar that decides to own up to 5 different horses, train and perform in a variety of up to 8 different horse show events, each with a different theme, variety of movements and a musical accompaniment.\n\nThe game has a good tutorial system to walk the player through how to keep the stats high for the horse and perform in each show well to score a large number of points needed for achievements, a nice glossary that will demonstrate and describe each special horse movement or each horse breed and the choice of background music played in each show are great by matching the themes featured in each show very well.\n\nAmong the cons, the somewhat repetitive nature of the game where you are required to take the horse for a run, feed it to capacity and then clean to groom it up each time after a failed or less than perfect attempt in any show to have a chance at earning maximum points(needed for some achievements) instead of being able to restart the show immediately, the presence of a few bugs in the game(I spotted two where clicking on the in-game take screenshot option will cause the game to crash. Another was when opening the show list during the tutorial segment when no shows are unlocked yet will result in not being able to return to the previous window, forcing the player to close and re-open game.) and one achievement that was somewhat harder than the other achievements(Highscore) and may require more than 10 attempts in some shows that need to be attempted at Hard difficulty in every show.\n\nOverall, this game is recommended when at discount or bundle offer for those looking for a nice 3D simulation game with action segments and great accompanying background music, a nice and useful glossary to describe and explain different horse breeds and horse movement techniques, attractive achievement icons and achievements that are more or less reasonable.",
